iterations.reply:
I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm`, so it has no authority to append to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or to call an HTTP client. The enrichment request would also send each item's text to an external host, which exfiltrates untrusted feed data. Those two behaviors need a node that holds the matching grants and an explicit decision about the outbound data.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{feed-item, classification};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(item: feed-item) -> classification;
}
```

